  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.0: Quality of Life & Optional MCP Features - Tool Lifecycle Hooks (monitor invocations, metrics, authorization), Resource Subscriptions (optional MCP 2025-11-25 feature, exact URI matching), Better Error Messages (tool suggestions, schema hints), Authorization Support (role-based access control example). New: IToolLifecycleHook interface, LoggingToolLifecycleHook, MetricsToolLifecycleHook, resources/subscribe, resources/unsubscribe, AuthorizationMcpServer example, MetricsMcpServer example. 100% backward compatible, 273/273 tests passing, 2000+ lines new documentation. See: https://github.com/eyjolfurgudnivatne/mcp.gateway/releases/tag/v1.8.0",
